%% Asynchronous behaviour. There are no queues or background jobs in this repo; async work is
%% RSC streaming, client refetches, and token refresh. Source: section server/ components,
%% src/hooks/, src/lib/bearer-token.ts, src/app/events/housing/actions.ts. Verified at commit 61e748e.
sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser
  participant S as RSC page
  participant T as bearer-token cache
  participant A as AUTH_SERVICE
  participant UP as Upstreams
  B->>S: GET /events/housing?evtstub=...
  S->>T: get server token
  alt token missing or past 80% of lifetime
    T->>A: mint from API_KEY
    A-->>T: token
  end
  S->>UP: start section reads (promises)
  S-->>B: shell streamed first
  UP-->>S: section data
  S-->>B: sections stream in (Suspense)
  B->>S: filter change via GET route (hooks)
  S-->>B: new ViewModel
  B->>S: server action (link, unlink, magic link)
  S-->>B: ActionResult, revalidatePath re-renders page
